{"id":"2086519476707767126","kind":"answer","title":"凭兴趣学好日语容易吗？","author":"Jarrett Ye","original_authors":["Jarrett Ye"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"外语习得","date":"2026-09-24","updated":"2026-09-24","votes":128,"comment_count":22,"minutes":2,"chars":790,"keywords":["日语学习","沉浸式学习","二语习得","Anki","可理解输入"],"summary":"如果这个问题是一百年前提的，那可能还真不容易。 砖头厚的日语辞典你总得有吧？日语小说上哪里买去？背单词得自己手写单词卡。想要听日语广播得折腾收音机。日本动漫那更是没得看了。好消息大概是：片假名地狱会少一点。 但是现在是 2026 年，电子辞典唾手可得，间隔重复软件到处都是，日漫资源极大丰富，真是个自学日语的好时代。 我从去年…","question_detail_html":"<p>本人13岁，男</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/1898106999582987835/answer/2086519476707767126","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"aDvhcqQA\">如果这个问题是一百年前提的，那可能还真不容易。</p><p data-pid=\"6JZEPbGS\">砖头厚的日语辞典你总得有吧？日语小说上哪里买去？背单词得自己手写单词卡。想要听日语广播得折腾收音机。日本动漫那更是没得看了。好消息大概是：片假名地狱会少一点。</p><p data-pid=\"2-5W-oj0\">但是现在是 2026 年，电子辞典唾手可得，间隔重复软件到处都是，日漫资源极大丰富，真是个自学日语的好时代。</p><p data-pid=\"onog6o0S\">我从去年 8 月底开始自学日语，到现在也快 13 个月了，日均 2 小时左右，主要就背单词、看番、看轻小说、听有声书（最近开始）：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-6c9df973d6fb4bf13da1c709b5574ac4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-6c9df973d6fb4bf13da1c709b5574ac4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1462\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-6c9df973d6fb4bf13da1c709b5574ac4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6c9df973d6fb4bf13da1c709b5574ac4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1462\"/><figcaption>codex 根据我电脑上各类日语学习工具的数据制作的</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"ZmX3-poY\">看番学日语：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-5eb3f94e72df2f98c9b73ac14b710a40\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5eb3f94e72df2f98c9b73ac14b710a40_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2704\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-5eb3f94e72df2f98c9b73ac14b710a40\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-5eb3f94e72df2f98c9b73ac14b710a40_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2704\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"xuZZKyDk\">看轻小说学日语：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-a5090182003a7ebead1cab4a78b4f46d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a5090182003a7ebead1cab4a78b4f46d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2704\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-a5090182003a7ebead1cab4a78b4f46d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a5090182003a7ebead1cab4a78b4f46d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2704\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"jz78cDQE\">听有声书学日语：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-a2d7f4dd71fe9087d1be2c164a46e186\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a2d7f4dd71fe9087d1be2c164a46e186_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2704\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-a2d7f4dd71fe9087d1be2c164a46e186\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a2d7f4dd71fe9087d1be2c164a46e186_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2704\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ejQlkxf3\">背单词：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-904b6d6c45848534c17cfdf104e18ecc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-904b6d6c45848534c17cfdf104e18ecc_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2704\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-904b6d6c45848534c17cfdf104e18ecc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-904b6d6c45848534c17cfdf104e18ecc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2704\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"mNY3N2ni\">还有现成的动漫牌组：<a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-title=\"看动漫学日语：零基础日语听力&amp;语法课程\" data-icon-name=\"zhicon_icon_24_link\" href=\"https://www.markji.com/deck/6a2a8d6220c7211c3334c9f7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">看动漫学日语：零基础日语听力&amp;语法课程</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"TAdBZL0X\">可以说现在就是凭兴趣学日语有史以来最容易的时代。</p><p data-pid=\"02hspV3h\">要找匹配自己目前水平的沉浸材料？可以上 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://jiten.moe/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Jiten</a>：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-8b2eb5c1044df0d6b685a47aa5584ca2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-8b2eb5c1044df0d6b685a47aa5584ca2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1832\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-8b2eb5c1044df0d6b685a47aa5584ca2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-8b2eb5c1044df0d6b685a47aa5584ca2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1832\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"dd9gYESL\">要边看动画边查词？可以用 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://app.asbplayer.dev/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Asbplayer</a> + <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://yomitan.wiki/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Yomitan</a>。字幕可以在 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://jimaku.cc/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Jimaku</a> 上找。</p><p data-pid=\"Hw5Bpmj-\">要边读轻小说或有声书边查词？可以用 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://github.com/Manhhao/Hoshi-Reader\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hoshi Reader</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"4mV9BPwH\">我从今年三月份开始读第一本轻小说，到现在已经读完 19 本，将近两百万字：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-ca45c8128616ef63bdfe0a0595440982\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ca45c8128616ef63bdfe0a0595440982_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2550\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-ca45c8128616ef63bdfe0a0595440982\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ca45c8128616ef63bdfe0a0595440982_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2550\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"YoFsqwdq\">动画也看了 48 部：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-6ce360eb6158ad0616cfe183dbf7353d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-6ce360eb6158ad0616cfe183dbf7353d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1796\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-6ce360eb6158ad0616cfe183dbf7353d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6ce360eb6158ad0616cfe183dbf7353d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1796\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"B9R4rQp4\">今年 7 月也顺便把 N2 给过了：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"750\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"750\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"NgXDUz6a\">这就是兴趣 + 技术的力量。</p><p data-pid=\"SgXrZvhl\">跟别说我去年刚学日语的时候，还是自己在看 TheMoeWay 的面向英文母语者的日语自学教程，现在已经有了更加详细的、面向中文母语者的日语学习指南了：</p><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"‌​​​​⁠​‬‬​​‬​​‍﻿​​⁠​​⁠​​‍​‍‌​‬​​‌​﻿‌​​​‌​​​‬‍‌​﻿​基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南 - 飞书云文档\" href=\"https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/YeOSwsG7giLuQxkcDFscUXVZn2f\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">‌​​​​⁠​‬‬​​‬​​‍﻿​​⁠​​⁠​​‍​‍‌​‬​​‌​﻿‌​​​‌​​​‬‍‌​﻿​基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南 - 飞书云文档</a><p data-pid=\"YQcMKjP-\">这里还有几篇外国人凭兴趣学会日语的例子，题主若感兴趣，也可以读一读：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8f52847279b5d684c6b9e77d5831dd0b.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"日语N1如何满分？\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/43551548/answer/2080009361598984716\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日语N1如何满分？</a><a class=\"internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d4ed075cfd9503296d2e853218cf0c5f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"我怎么备考日语n1，还是放弃比较好？\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/2008511709527159502/answer/2079153915543790614\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我怎么备考日语n1，还是放弃比较好？</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"老外玩成人游戏学日语神速过了二级，这种非传统方法为何有效？\" data-tm-id=\"2075973874634712098\" href=\"#/post/2075973874634712098\">老外玩成人游戏学日语神速过了二级，这种非传统方法为何有效？</a><p data-pid=\"DVD1tMD8\">Just do it.</p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"2002818500717207719","title":"日语学习指南","author":"Shoui","votes":427,"minutes":23,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"2003200028689338460","title":"30 天入门日语","author":"UsagiSpoon","votes":254,"minutes":35,"reason":"延伸深读 · UsagiSpoon"},{"id":"2003548240998597680","title":"学日语之 Shoui 方法","author":"Shoui","votes":92,"minutes":67,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"},{"id":"2005215549949514985","title":"单语指南","author":"Shoui","votes":70,"minutes":15,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"},{"id":"2004873847392974568","title":"阅读技巧与策略","author":"Shoui","votes":102,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"},{"id":"2005581871279519232","title":"日语学习常见问题解答（FAQ）","author":"Shoui","votes":169,"minutes":23,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2007436816991671196","title":"为什么除了中日之外，就没有国家有人喜欢二次元了呢?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":1901,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 1901 赞同"},{"id":"2102462801965065232","title":"为什么好多人学日语坚持不下去？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":123,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 123 赞同"},{"id":"2014122475764601075","title":"想要做到看懂日语生肉漫画和小说该怎么做？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":50,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 50 赞同"},{"id":"2053439845024920936","title":"对于日语学习者，如何选择和开始阅读第一本日文原版书？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":102,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 102 赞同"},{"id":"2085442988537398276","title":"我要日语到达N几才能大致看懂一篇日语小说？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":142,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 142 赞同"}]}